      en: ["Misty tropical forest", "Over 900 meters elevation", "Home to endemic bird species", "Popular recreation and hiking spot"],
      es: ["Clima fresco de montaña", "Parte del parque nacional", "Diversos bosques de helechos"],
      pt: ["Clima fresco de montanha", "Parte do parque nacional", "Diversas florestas de fetos"],
      fr: ["Climat de montagne frais", "Partie du parc national", "Forêts de fougères variées"],
